<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aestĭfer</span></b> , fēra,
			fĕrum, adj.
		aestus-fero
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>bringing</i>, <i>causing</i>, or <i>producing
			heat</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					1, 663</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 612</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 353</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic. Arat. 111</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 1,
			194</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 585
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Pass.</i>, <i>heated</i>, <i>sultry</i>, <i>hot</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Libyum arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					1, 206</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi Garamantum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					17, 448</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
